{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1488770-demon-blooded-questions","id":1488770,"title":"Demon Blooded questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-02T00:51:06-07:00","id":1488770,"title":"Demon Blooded questions","content":"I'm finally mastering a Heirs to Hell campaign (!!!!) and have a couple of questions that aren't explicitly answered in the book, or at least I haven't found them.<br /> <br /> -Can Demon Blooded buy more embeds the traditional way, with xp?<br /> <br /> -Can Demon Blooded craft Gadgets?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-02T05:48:31-07:00","id":1488808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeneas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1488770-demon-blooded-questions#post1488770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Can Demon Blooded buy more embeds the traditional way, with xp?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Learning a new Embed costs 4 Experiences for demon-blooded characters.&quot; Page 30.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Can Demon Blooded craft Gadgets? </div> </div> </div>No.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T04:12:41-07:00","id":1490114,"title":"","content":"Sorry for taking so long to answer! I didn't have access to my computer for a while and I kinda forgot about this thread.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, I made my own Demon Blooded rules. These are built specifically the Demon Blooded character in my game, which will (eventually) bring theplayer against higher tier threats. The character has both an Aether Pool and the Quantum Understanding merit and the rules are built around it.<br /> <br /> -They can't buy Embeds (Will have to change this one! I will probably make him explore what Embeds are in order to unlock this).<br /> -They can build Gadgets (Again, they have to discover how to do this).<br /> -They can learn Embeds from dissasembling Gadgets. In facts, their ability to understand quantum superposittion (in contrast to demons, who can manipulate it) let them learn Exploits from dissassembly and even let them learn &quot;Lambda powers&quot;, powers that imitate a Lambda gadget effects.<br /> <br /> i understand that the last aprt might make them very strong, but they are created taking into consideration that Lambdas aren't common and dissasembling one isn't a cheap feat. Also, &quot;Lambda powers&quot; are based on the original gadgets ability, but aren't a exact copy, kind of like a reverse Near Field.<br /> <br /> Any comments or criticisms are welcome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","user":"Aeneas","date":".  Edit: \u00bfShoulds I change the title of the thread after derrailing it? \u00bfHow do you change a title anyway? 08-14-2022, 07:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T06:13:40-07:00","id":1490125,"title":"","content":"The main issues with letting demon-blooded create (and learn from) gadgets are that:<br /> 1. Installation requires Aether, which not all demon-blooded can hold or even manipulate, and those that can do so are limited to supercharging Embeds (explicitly not a terribly controlled process) and aetheric resonance.<br /> 2. Installation uses knowledge a demon has as part of having been part of the God-Machine (see Flowers of Hell, p156), which demon-blooded characters obviously do not have.<br /> 3. Learning Embeds and Exploits from gadgets via reverse engineering/Uninstallation is a process that destroys the gadget, rather than disassembling a gadget being a process that lets demons learn Embeds and Exploits, and the process of reverse-engineering causes a demon to radiate aetheric resonance even though it doesn't usually cost Aether (Flowers p144), which at least seems like it precludes characters who don't naturally do that from undertaking the process.<br /> <br /> The issue I see with learning &quot;Lambda powers&quot; from disassembling lambdas is that demon-blooded characters already have Interlocks filling this role, which have their own cost that an Heirs game should probably not discard without thought.<br /> <br /> The path of least resistance for facilitating such a thing would be to include a Merit or set of Merits giving the character the necessary finesse and techgnosis to manage the process of Installation; further usage requirements may be necessary, like performing the act in Infrastructure. The character's Interlocks might be an alternative mechanical route to this, but that would require a little more care given what the demon-blooded Cipher is.<br /> <br /> tl;dr Gadget creation is based in aspects of demonic metaphysics that are sufficiently internal that it could be part of the sort of &quot;uplift humanity&quot; Hell that the corebook mentions, and letting beings who aren't demons do them should be at least as difficult as becoming a sorcerer in Mummy, if not moreso.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-14T08:24:34-07:00","id":1490133,"title":"","content":"Thanks for answering again, you make great points.<br /> <br /> I didn't say it in the last message, but Gadget creation will not be avialable to him on character creation. Basically, the idea behind the game is that they go from young a confused to something more akin to John Constantine through a long game. I loved Heirs of Hell and that's why I'm using it as a launch pad, but I was planning to go further than that.<br /> <br /> Both me and the player both love the Gadget system, so I thought this was a cool way to mark this growth, but maybe you are right. I will think about it. Thanks again <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Edit: I forgot to say, this isn't supposed to be a &quot;patch&quot; to the supplement, which I really like, but a set of homebrew rules for a specific game (that's why I assume the DB will have Aether, I know they do). Just clarifying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","user":"Aeneas","date":".  Forgot something 08-14-2022, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27168-aeneas","name":"Aeneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}